--[[
    UNIVERSAL PRO v4.3 — DEEP FREEZE FIX BUILD
    Root causes of freeze addressed here:
    1. IsNPC() was called inline during cache scan — heavy string ops on every model every frame
    2. ESP updateESP ran on RenderStepped with GetExtentsSize() every frame
    3. scanWorkspace blocked thread — GetDescendants on load with no yield
    4. UpdateCaches had 200-entry yield gap (too wide)
    5. Obsidian UI HttpGets (3 of them) ran synchronously before script could continue
    6. BypassAdonis iterated GetDescendants synchronously on spawn
    7. Anti-kick pcall fired on every spawn tick

    Fixes:
    - IsNPC result cached per-model (NPC_Identity_Cache), never rechecked unless model is new
    - ESP moved to Heartbeat with 12fps cap + GetExtentsSize cached per model (2s TTL)
    - scanWorkspace fully async with yield every 20 models
    - UpdateCaches yields every 5 entries
    - Obsidian UI loads in task.spawn (non-blocking)
    - BypassAdonis GetDescendants scan yields every 50
    - AntiKick interval raised to 90s
    - IsFriend cached per UserId (no repeated API calls)
    - RaycastParams reused (not reconstructed every call)
]]

